883]: 1 Cor. x. 18 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-883"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-884]: Rom. ix. 6 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-884"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-885]: Matt. xv. 24 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-885"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-886]: Ebion, Heb. ןוֹיבְאֶ , (from הבָאָ , to desire), lit. “wishing,” “desiring;” secondarily, “poor.”","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-886"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-887]: Gal. iv. 26 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-887"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-888]: Cf. Heb. xii. 22, 23 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-888"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-889]: Infernus.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-889"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-890]: Velut illic, si dici potest, morientes.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-890"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-891]: A superis.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-891"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-892]: Cf. Ps. xxx. 3. and Deut. xxxii. 22 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-892"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-893]: Corporaliter.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-893"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-894]: Matt. xiii. 44 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-894"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-895]: Ad propinquitatem pertinent Israel.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-895"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-896]: Rom. ix. 6 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-first-principles-vi-v-896"},{"text":"[^origen-first-principles-vi-v-897]: Ex ipsis Septuaginta animabus fiunt aliqui.","kind":"commentary","not